flowchart TD
  A[main.py\n(entry point)] --> B[load_config\n(YAML + schema + env)]
  A --> C[setup_logging\n(colored or JSON)]
  A --> D[validate_environment\n(env var checks)]

  B --> E[MLflow start_run]
  E --> F{Diagnostics enabled?}
  F -->|yes| G[run_snapshot_diagnostics]
  F -->|no| H{HPO enabled?}
  G --> H

  H -->|yes| I[run_hyperparameter_search\n(Optuna)]
  H -->|no| J[run_training_pipeline]

  I --> K{run_mode == trial?}
  K -->|yes| L[exit]
  K -->|no| J

  J --> M[evaluate_snapshot_model]
  M --> N[MLflow end_run]
